'\"
'\" tkufiledialog.n -- modal file/directory dialog
.TH TKUFILEDIALOG n "0.2" "tkutils" "Tkutils Widgets"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkufiledialog \- modal open/save/directory chooser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBpackage require tkutils::tkufiledialog\fR ?0.2?
.sp
\fB::tkutils::tkufiledialog::open\fR ?\fIoptions\fR?
\fB::tkutils::tkufiledialog::save\fR ?\fIoptions\fR?
\fB::tkutils::tkufiledialog::directory\fR ?\fIoptions\fR?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provider-backed modal picker built from \fBtkupath\fR and \fBtkufilelist\fR.
Returns a path (or a list with \fB\-multiple\fR), or empty if cancelled.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-parent\fR \fIw\fR
Transient parent toplevel.
.TP
\fB\-title\fR \fIt\fR
Window title.
.TP
\fB\-initialdir\fR \fId\fR
Start directory.
.TP
\fB\-provider\fR \fIp\fR
A \fBtuprovider\fR (default: local).
.TP
\fB\-filetypes\fR \fIlist\fR
As for \fBtk_getOpenFile\fR; first extension drives the list filter.
.TP
\fB\-multiple\fR \fI0|1\fR
Open only: return a list of paths.
.TP
\fB\-initialfile\fR \fIname\fR / \fB\-defaultextension\fR \fI.ext\fR
Save only.
.SH SEE ALSO
tkufilelist(n), tkupath(n), tkudialog(n)
